accTitle: Cutover launches from a caught-up replica
accDescr: Source root and data disks replicate to staging, testing precedes a final write freeze and catch-up, and a fresh cutover launch becomes the production writer.
S["Source root and data disks"] --> R[("Continuously replicated staging disks")]
R --> T["Test application and dependencies"]
T --> F["Freeze source writes and verify catch-up"]
F --> C["Launch fresh cutover instances"]
C --> P["Validate and move production traffic"]
